        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);

        System.out.println("Enter first number:");
        int num1 = scanner.nextInt();   // Read integer

        System.out.println("Enter second number:");
        int num2 = scanner.nextInt();   // Read integer

        System.out.println("Sum of two numbers: " + (num1 + num2));

        scanner.close();
    }
}
```

#### Additional Tips:
- Always check if the user has entered valid input. For instance, after reading integers, you might want to perform validation checks.
- Consider adding error handling to gracefully manage invalid input cases.

